  "instructions": [
    "Chop the onion, carrots, celery, fennel, and mince the garlic.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat and sauté the vegetables until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the thyme, bay leaf, and a pinch of salt and pepper, cooking for another minute.",
    "Pour in the water and bring to a gentle boil, then reduce to a simmer and let the broth cook for 15 minutes.",
    "Add the toasted almonds and continue to simmer for an additional 10 minutes, allowing the almond flavor to infuse.",
    "Stir in the fresh grapefruit juice and lemon zest, if using, and simmer for 5 more minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from heat and strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a bowl.",
    "Serve the broth hot, garnished with a thin slice of fresh grapefruit or a sprig of thyme if desired."
  ],
